Subject: Accept array $pasteUpdate in cmdmap hooks

TYPO3 core passes $pasteUpdate as array (the update payload) for
copy/move commands with an "update" key, e.g. visual-editor drop
zones. The bool-only type crashed every such DataHandler call with a
TypeError. Neither hook uses the parameter.

